{#- Time estimation (FR-CLOCK-7; #199, #201): one undeclared narrated skip. The model works out,
    reason first, when what the sentence narrates is over, from what the scene established, and
    answers with a clock time or an amount; the engine does every clock subtraction (across
    midnight), validates the answer, records it with its reason and confidence, and still
    decides whether the skip may stand (FR-CLOCK-8). -#}
{% block system %}
You estimate how much story time one sentence of a story lets pass: from the moment the
sentence starts until what it narrates is over. Use the activity and the times the story
established; when the story does not say how long, use ordinary knowledge of how long such
a thing usually takes (a meal, a film, a drive, a flight between two cities).

Answer only with a JSON object. First "reason": one or two short sentences on what the sentence
skips to and how long that takes, or when it happens.
{% if clock %}
Then the time, in one of these ways (leave the other field null):
- "ends_at": the clock time (HH:MM) the skip ends at, whenever the story lets you tell it: a
  stated end ("the alarm is set for 06:30" gives "06:30", "the shop opens at 08:00" gives
  "08:00", "due to land at 12:30" gives "12:30"), or when the activity began plus how long it
  runs ("the shift started at 06:00" and "shifts are six hours long" give "12:00"). Work the
  end out in the reason as "started 06:00 + 6 hours = ends 12:00"; never subtract the clock
  yourself: the engine counts the minutes from the clock to "ends_at", across midnight.
- "minutes": how long the sentence skips, only when no clock time applies.
{% else %}
Then "minutes": how long the sentence skips, always a number.
{% endif %}
A stated amount counts in full: "forty minutes later" is 40, "works an eight-hour shift" is 480,
"watches a two-hour film" is 120, unless the story says part of it has already passed.
Finally "confidence", 0.0-1.0: high when the story or ordinary knowledge makes the duration
clear, low only when it is a guess.
{% endblock %}
{% block user %}
{% if clock %}
